    #    off) over probe-zip-xml, judged against the Milestone 2 ceiling of
    #    458752 section bytes as a fact: under or over it, by how much;
    #  - the part's own cost, the format probe over
    #    probe-emend-fullstyles-write-xml rebuilt at the same commit;
    #  - the rowcol feature's cost, probe-emend-rowcol-write-xml over the format
    #    probe, beside the budget and outside it;
    #  - the whole growth since part 2's 399176, split into the part's own cost
    #    and the fullstyles probe's drift less probe-zip-xml's;
    #  - the dates feature's cost, outside the budget, as part 2's record carries
    #    it.
    #
    # CARRIED TO M2 part 3 P4 from M2 part 2 P3's size script (printed in
    # records/logs/m2p2-p3/size.log; its change list A to G is there), with the
    # pieces of M2 part 3 P3's size script named below (printed in
    # records/logs/m2p3-p3/size.log, its changes D to I), audited against
    # specs/0001 "Rules for every phase" and specs/0018, and grepped for part 2
    # P3's and part 3 P3's names, paths, subjects and typed lists. What differs,
